**"Redistribution"** means providing copies of the Software or a Modified Work to another party, whether publicly or privately.

**"Commercial Server"** means a game server operated for commercial purposes, including servers receiving donations, subscriptions, or revenue from in-game purchases.

**"Prohibited Resale"** means offering, licensing, sublicensing, or distributing the Software or a Modified Work in exchange for money, cryptocurrency, credits, or other consideration, where the Software or Modified Work itself is part of what the customer purchases.

